<div id="A4.p3" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p3.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p3.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question 2:
<br class="ltx_break"></span>A mother with blood type O and a father with blood type AB have twins, both sons, with blood type B. Given that 32% of all twins have different genders, calculate the probability that the twins are identical.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p4" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p4.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p4.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tool 2:
<br class="ltx_break"></span></p>
<div id="A4.p4.2" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
            
            
            
          <span id="lstnumberx19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">from</span><span id="lstnumberx19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx19.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">collections</span><span id="lstnumberx19.5" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx19.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">import</span><span id="lstnumberx19.7" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx19.8" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">Counter</span>
