<div id="A4.p5" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p5.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p5.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Question 3:
<br class="ltx_break"></span>You have two coins: a fair coin with a probability of heads as 0.5, and a biased coin with a probability of heads as 0.8. You randomly select one of these coins and flip it repeatedly, obtaining heads each time. Determine the minimum number of consecutive heads required such that the probability of the coin being fair is less than 0.1.</p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p6" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p6.1" class="ltx_p"><span id="A4.p6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Tool 3:</span></p>
</div>
<div id="A4.p7" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<div id="A4.p7.1" class="ltx_listing ltx_lst_language_Python ltx_lst_numbers_left ltx_lstlisting ltx_framed ltx_framed_rectangle ltx_listing"><div class="ltx_listing_data"><a href="data:text/plain;base64," download="">⬇</a></div>
<div id="lstnumberx45" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1</span>
            
            
            
          <span id="lstnumberx45.2" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_keyword ltx_font_typewriter" style="--ltx-fg-color:#0000FF;">def</span><span id="lstnumberx45.3" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_space ltx_font_typewriter"> </span><span id="lstnumberx45.4" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">equal_priors</span><span id="lstnumberx45.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">(</span><span id="lstnumberx45.6" class="ltx_text ltx_lst_identifier ltx_font_typewriter">items</span><span id="lstnumberx45.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">):</span>
</div>
<div id="lstnumberx46" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2</span>
            
            
            
